1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,130
Percentage

2
00:00:03,130 --> 00:00:05,750
Example 1:

3
00:00:05,750 --> 00:00:11,220
Area of vegetable garden is 100 m<sup>2</sup>

4
00:00:11,220 --> 00:00:17,840
Among them 20 m<sup>2</sup> planted with cabbage.

5
00:00:17,840 --> 00:00:29,400
Find ratio of cabbage planting area and vegetable garden area.

6
00:00:30,280 --> 00:00:45,840
Ratio of cabbage planting area and vegetable garden area is 20 divided by 100

7
00:00:46,710 --> 00:00:57,260
We fill: 20 hundredths equals 20%

8
00:00:57,260 --> 00:01:13,930
Read: twenty percent

9
00:01:15,770 --> 00:01:29,200
We say: Percentage of cabbage planting area and vegetable garden area is 20%

10
00:01:29,200 --> 00:01:39,600
Or cabbage planting area occupies 20% of vegetable garden area.

11
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,950
Example 2:

12
00:01:43,950 --> 00:01:51,020
A school has 480 students,

13
00:01:51,020 --> 00:01:58,970
among them 192 students participate in English club.

14
00:01:59,460 --> 00:02:11,440
Ask percentage of students participating in English club over total number of students in school?

15
00:02:11,440 --> 00:02:18,310
To solve this problem we do as follows

16
00:02:18,310 --> 00:02:29,910
Fill ratio of students participating in English club and students of whole school

17
00:02:29,910 --> 00:02:43,440
Convert to fraction, perform simplification then convert to percentage.

18
00:02:44,440 --> 00:02:54,150
Ratio of students participating in English club and whole school students is:

19
00:02:54,150 --> 00:03:05,260
192 divided by 480 or 192 hundredths

20
00:03:05,260 --> 00:03:28,420
We have: 192 divided by 480 = 192 hundredths = 40 hundredths = 40%

21
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:41,570
We have percentage of students participating in English club and whole school students is 40%

22
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:53,260
Or students participating in English club occupy 40% of whole school students.

23
00:03:54,220 --> 00:04:04,750
This ratio tells for every 100 students of school then 40 students participate in English club.

